      '# Court Listener C# API Library\n\nThe Court Listener C# SDK provides convenient access to the [Court Listener REST API](https://www.courtlistener.com/contact/) from applications written in   C#.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ngit clone git@github.com:stainless-sdks/court-listener-sdk-csharp.git\ndotnet add reference court-listener-sdk-csharp/src/CourtListenerSdk\n```\n\n## Requirements\n\nThis library requires .NET Standard 2.0 or later.\n\n## Usage\n\nSee the [`examples`](examples) directory for complete and runnable examples.\n\n```csharp\nCourtListenerClient client = new();\n\nCourtListParams parameters = new();\n\nvar page = await client.Courts.List(parameters);\n\nConsole.WriteLine(page);\n```',
